scarga de contactos a archivos CSV.\",\"en\":\" \"}},{\"version\":\"1.2.0 \\u221a\",\"information\":{\"es\":\"1- Agrega Mapa de calor y nuevos indicadores al tablero Gerencial.\\n2- Nuevo reporte de viajes por segmentos.\",\"en\":\" \"}},{\"version\":\"1.1.0 \\u221a\",\"information\":{\"es\":\"1- Agrega la posibilidad de cancelar saldos de Ctas. Ctes. con Tarjeta de cr\\u00e9dito.\\n2- Nuevos Reportes:\\n  a. Ranking de Veh\\u00edculos.\\n  b. Ranking de Choferes.\\n  c. Ranking de Clientes.\",\"en\":\" \"}},{\"version\":\"1.0.0 \\u221a\",\"information\":{\"es\":\"1- Nuevos filtros de Fechas que permite al usuario configurar rangos en los paneles.\\n2- Nueva Sala de CHAT que facilita la comunicaci\\u00f3n del chofer con el pasajero.\\n3- Agrega los viajes programados a la asignaci\\u00f3n autom\\u00e1tica de choferes.\\n4- Nuevo Marketplace de Integraciones soportadas.\\n5- Nueva versi\\u00f3n de APP Passenger:\\n  a. Agrega un nuevo aspecto m\\u00e1s amigable.\\n  b. Seguimiento de viaje en curso en el mapa\",\"en\":\" \"}}]"},"redirectURL":"","headersSize":552,"bodySize":1698,"_transferSize":2250,"_error":null,"_fetchedViaServiceWorker":false},"serverIPAddress":"3.5.131.211","startedDateTime":"2026-09-11T14:12:08.117Z","time":235.01099999703,"timings":{"blocked":3.3359999980838038,"dns":-1,"ssl":-1,"connect":-1,"send":0.09800000000000009,"wait":207.37899999978626,"receive":24.197999999159947,"_blocked_queueing":2.379999998083804,"_workerStart":-1,"_workerReady":-1,"_workerFetchStart":-1,"_workerRespondWithSettled":-1},"_connectionId":"281862"},{"_initiator":{"type":"script","stack":{"callFrames":[{"functionName":"d","scriptId":"437","url":"https://apps.magiis.com/polyfills.57f0282707e064b756be.bundle.js","lineNumber":0,"columnNumber":76229},{"functionName":"","scriptId":"437","url":"https://apps.magiis.com/polyfills.57f0282707e064b756be.bundle.js","lineNumber":0,"columnNumber":45453},{"functionName":"onScheduleTask","scriptId":"437","url":"https://apps.magiis.com/